        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>孩子积食后的特效食疗处方</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      background: #d9d5ca;\n      color: #24211b;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 17px 27px 27px 29px;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120, 96, 55, 0.035), transparent 6%, transparent 92%, rgba(87, 65, 35, 0.08)),\n        linear-gradient(180deg, #eee9d9 0%, #f3eedf 47%, #ece5d3 100%);\n      box-shadow: 3px 0 8px rgba(54, 42, 24, 0.26);\n    }\n\n    .page::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 0;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      opacity: 0.17;\n      background-image:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          0deg,\n          transparent 0,\n          transparent 3px,\n          rgba(90, 75, 50, 0.025) 4px\n        );\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      margin: 0 0 48px 0;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.98;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      text-align: justify;\n      text-justify: inter-ideograph;\n    }\n\n    p {\n      margin: 0;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .formula {\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .blue-underline {\n      text-decoration-line: underline;\n      text-decoration-color: #25447e;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;\n      text-underline-offset: 7px;\n      text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n      left: 14px;\n      bottom: 2px;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: #4d4940;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 540px) {\n      .page {\n        width: 100vw;\n        height: calc(100vw * 1.333333);\n        min-height: 667px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <h1>13. 孩子积食后的特效食疗处方</h1>\n\n    <article class=\"content\">\n      <p>出现积食的症状的时候，我建议给孩子喝点儿<span class=\"blue-underline\">焦三仙配炒鸡内金煮的水</span>。</p>\n\n      <p>有的时候我发现孩子没有任何其他的症状，只是<span class=\"blue-underline\">舌苔变厚了，嘴里有味道</span>，我也会让他喝一两次<span class=\"blue-underline\">焦三仙配炒鸡内金</span>，因为有可能他的病马上就来了，要提前化解掉。</p>\n\n      <p>我觉得<span class=\"blue-underline\">焦三仙和炒鸡内金</span>，是所有家庭里面应该必备的药材。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"formula\">具体配方：焦三仙，即<span class=\"blue-underline\">焦麦芽、焦山楂、焦神曲</span>各6克，炒鸡内金6克。</p>\n\n      <p>鸡内金是鸡胃里面那个黄色的膜，一定要用炒的鸡内金。你在药店里买焦三仙和炒鸡内金各6克，包成1包，家里一定要放上几包，放在玻璃瓶子里面密封好。但凡孩子积食了，立刻放1包煮水，开锅后小火再煮20分钟就可以了，喝一两天就可以消掉积食。这是所有孩子的家庭必备的。</p>\n\n      <p>有的时候，你把炒鸡内金磨碎了，给孩子冲水喝、煮水喝也行。还有，家里面的锅巴也可以消积食，把锅巴炒黑了以后研成末，冲水给孩子喝。但是一般我主张用焦三仙和炒鸡内金煮水喝，这四味药比较平和全面，基本上就能解决孩子的积食。</p>\n\n      <p>现在孩子感冒、发烧，实际上相当比例是积食引起的。有经验的老中医，在治疗孩子脾胃疾病的时候，只要看到孩子肚子有点儿</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">98</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
